  {
    "route": "project-post-industrial-renaissance",
    "nodeId": "17:1407",
    "title": "Post-Industrial Renaissance",
    "subtitle": "Urban Renewal Design in the Beijing Thermal Power Plant Area Based on the Co-living Concept",
    "year": "2021",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "nodeId": "23:70",
        "html": "The design site, located in Chaoyang District in Beijing, aims to revitalize the abandoned industrial relics of the Beijing Thermal Power Plant. The project, based on the Co-living concept, provides diverse housing options for digital nomads, students, and entrepreneurs, fostering a unique community atmosphere. By transforming industrial relics into a vibrant residential community, the design embodies the concept of &quot;shared rebirth,&quot; symbolizing urban revitalization, historical homage, and optimism for the future.",
